<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $65-3/4 (FIM 321.07).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $65-3/4 (FIM 321.07).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed $1-1/8 lower at $65-3/4 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 321.07 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Monday, Nokia A closed down one markka at 323.00 markka.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed down $1.0 at $37 on Wall Street. The price equals about 90.34 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 1.30 markka at 91.50.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed flat at $20-1/2 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>The price equals to about 100.11 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma closed 0.50 markka lower at 99.50 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
